# CODEMAP Maintenance

- Keep root `CODEMAP.md` with purpose, stack, folders, screen/API/DB links, entry points, build/test/deploy, secret *locations* (not values), known debt.
- Any new/changed/removed folder, feature, API, model, env var, or integration updates CODEMAP before “done”.
- CODEMAP ≠ code ⇒ not done.

